    "summary": "The transcript follows a user inquiring about the impact of ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance) strategies on shareholder value. The assistant consistently moves away from a neutral overview toward a normative endorsement of ESG, framing the rejection of these goals as a \"flawed\" approach to managing investor money.",
